[
  {
    "text": "Mix red and yellow. Which colour did you make?",
    "key": "cb5ba7c0",
    "path": "/audio/en/cb5ba7c0-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The two primary paints are red and yellow.",
    "key": "e1e9cdda",
    "path": "/audio/en/e1e9cdda-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Equal scoops of red and yellow make an orange blend in our simple paint recipe.",
    "key": "3bba6ff3",
    "path": "/audio/en/3bba6ff3-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Mix blue and yellow. Which colour did you make?",
    "key": "41dd633d",
    "path": "/audio/en/41dd633d-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Try combining blue with yellow.",
    "key": "5cee2cd5",
    "path": "/audio/en/5cee2cd5-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Equal scoops of blue and yellow make a green blend in our simple paint recipe.",
    "key": "9d8ae693",
    "path": "/audio/en/9d8ae693-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Mix red and blue. Which colour did you make?",
    "key": "af97a0ec",
    "path": "/audio/en/af97a0ec-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Try combining red with blue.",
    "key": "3625d54a",
    "path": "/audio/en/3625d54a-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Equal scoops of red and blue make a purple blend in our simple paint recipe.",
    "key": "2329bcfb",
    "path": "/audio/en/2329bcfb-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Mix two scoops of blue and one scoop of yellow. Which colour did you make?",
    "key": "92e8d3f4",
    "path": "/audio/en/92e8d3f4-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Use twice as much blue as yellow.",
    "key": "36c1d1cc",
    "path": "/audio/en/36c1d1cc-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "More blue than yellow makes a blue-green blend. We call this recipe teal.",
    "key": "5e187c55",
    "path": "/audio/en/5e187c55-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Mix equal scoops of the three primary paints. Which colour did you make?",
    "key": "1045d8fe",
    "path": "/audio/en/1045d8fe-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Use one scoop of each primary paint.",
    "key": "85cc97db",
    "path": "/audio/en/85cc97db-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "In this simplified recipe, equal scoops of red, yellow and blue make a brown blend.",
    "key": "8e50f949",
    "path": "/audio/en/8e50f949-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Mix more yellow than blue. Which colour did you make?",
    "key": "1e7069d8",
    "path": "/audio/en/1e7069d8-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Use more yellow than blue.",
    "key": "a84266c9",
    "path": "/audio/en/a84266c9-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A larger share of yellow makes a bright yellow-green blend in our recipe.",
    "key": "068ab584",
    "path": "/audio/en/068ab584-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Mix these scoops, then look at the paint: did white make the red blend lighter or darker?",
    "key": "2e98f9af",
    "path": "/audio/en/2e98f9af-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Use more white than red.",
    "key": "4d17c8df",
    "path": "/audio/en/4d17c8df-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Two scoops of white mixed with one red make a lighter pink blend in this activity.",
    "key": "69be2f7c",
    "path": "/audio/en/69be2f7c-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Mix these scoops, then look at the paint: did white make the blue blend lighter or darker?",
    "key": "450e451c",
    "path": "/audio/en/450e451c-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Use three scoops of white for one blue.",
    "key": "b4ef698d",
    "path": "/audio/en/b4ef698d-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "More white than blue makes a pale sky-blue blend in our recipe.",
    "key": "7155fe97",
    "path": "/audio/en/7155fe97-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Mix these scoops, then look at the paint: did white make the black blend lighter or darker?",
    "key": "5cd14627",
    "path": "/audio/en/5cd14627-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Use much more white than black.",
    "key": "96a83ad6",
    "path": "/audio/en/96a83ad6-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A small scoop of black with more white makes a pale grey blend in our simplified model.",
    "key": "d26a0d98",
    "path": "/audio/en/d26a0d98-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Mix these scoops, then look at the paint: did black make the red blend lighter or darker?",
    "key": "91b50565",
    "path": "/audio/en/91b50565-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Add a little black to the red paint.",
    "key": "e2216ef2",
    "path": "/audio/en/e2216ef2-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A little black makes a darker red blend in this simplified paint activity.",
    "key": "c082d2e7",
    "path": "/audio/en/c082d2e7-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Mix these scoops, then look at the paint: did black make the blue blend lighter or darker?",
    "key": "b3c27416",
    "path": "/audio/en/b3c27416-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Add a little black to the blue paint.",
    "key": "d3288551",
    "path": "/audio/en/d3288551-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A little black makes a darker blue blend in this simplified paint activity.",
    "key": "9c3996a4",
    "path": "/audio/en/9c3996a4-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Mix these scoops, then look at the paint: did black make the white blend lighter or darker?",
    "key": "0a242d5b",
    "path": "/audio/en/0a242d5b-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Use two scoops of white with one black.",
    "key": "4634d879",
    "path": "/audio/en/4634d879-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Black darkens white into a dark grey blend in our simplified paint recipe.",
    "key": "07d0887e",
    "path": "/audio/en/07d0887e-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Choose a recipe, mix the paint, and match the sun badge.",
    "key": "f1a4f6a9",
    "path": "/audio/en/f1a4f6a9-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Red and yellow make the orange blend.",
    "key": "02213796",
    "path": "/audio/en/02213796-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The sun badge uses our orange recipe: equal scoops of red and yellow.",
    "key": "cb0e3134",
    "path": "/audio/en/cb0e3134-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Choose a recipe, mix the paint, and match the leaf.",
    "key": "42cab25e",
    "path": "/audio/en/42cab25e-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Blue and yellow make the green blend.",
    "key": "a636f02e",
    "path": "/audio/en/a636f02e-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The leaf uses our green recipe: equal scoops of blue and yellow.",
    "key": "c4a4418b",
    "path": "/audio/en/c4a4418b-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Choose a recipe, mix the paint, and match the berry.",
    "key": "1760ec56",
    "path": "/audio/en/1760ec56-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Red and blue make the purple blend.",
    "key": "7aa2882a",
    "path": "/audio/en/7aa2882a-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The berry uses our purple recipe: equal scoops of red and blue.",
    "key": "55c9b32d",
    "path": "/audio/en/55c9b32d-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Choose a recipe, mix the paint, and match the cloud.",
    "key": "7fdda8a1",
    "path": "/audio/en/7fdda8a1-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "More white than blue makes a pale blend.",
    "key": "5d08ac3a",
    "path": "/audio/en/5d08ac3a-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The cloud uses a pale blue recipe with three scoops of white for each blue scoop.",
    "key": "82336892",
    "path": "/audio/en/82336892-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Choose a recipe, mix the paint, and match the flower.",
    "key": "80e832f7",
    "path": "/audio/en/80e832f7-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Add more white than red.",
    "key": "e869fb7f",
    "path": "/audio/en/e869fb7f-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The flower uses our pink recipe: one red scoop and two white scoops.",
    "key": "67106744",
    "path": "/audio/en/67106744-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Choose a recipe, mix the paint, and match the wave.",
    "key": "fd5f8a01",
    "path": "/audio/en/fd5f8a01-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Use two blue scoops and one yellow.",
    "key": "b8d48a8f",
    "path": "/audio/en/b8d48a8f-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The wave uses a blue-green teal recipe with twice as much blue as yellow.",
    "key": "75432236",
    "path": "/audio/en/75432236-matilda.mp3",
    "existing": null
  },
  {
